    affiliation: "Memento Capital LLC"
title: "A sharp stability threshold for Erdős Problem 848: admissible sets not contained in a single extremal class have density at most 1/50"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-01"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
url: "https://github.com/Paulee314/erdos848"
abstract: "Sharp stability for Erdős Problem 848: any admissible set (ab+1 never squarefree) not contained in a single extremal mod-25 class has density at most 1/50, attained exactly by {7, 93} and {43, 57} mod 100. Includes the paper, stability computations, seating-chart certificates to N = 9,999,981, and records of an independent rebuild and kernel replay of A. C. Li's all-N Lean proof."
keywords:
  - "Erdos Problem 848"
  - "squarefree"
  - "admissible sets"
  - "stability"
  - "analytic number theory"
